  "description": "KA.Barcode Reader for EAN-8 from Word is a C# barcode scanner library to read, scan EAN-8 barcode from Word in your ASP.NET Core web and Windows applications.\n\nThis package includes detailed example C# source code to scan, read, decode EAN-8 data message from Word in .NET projects.\n\nGuides:\n* How to Guide : https://www.keepautomation.com/guide/csharp_barcode_reader.html\n* Email : support@keepautomation.com",
